     1001   ON ROW-DISPLAY OF br-term-dtr IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1002   DO:
     1003     ASSIGN
     1004     v-display-time-from = STRING(tt0-term_dis-time-rule.time-from, "HH:MM:SS")
     1005     v-display-time-to   = STRING(tt0-term_dis-time-rule.time-to, "HH:MM:SS").
