     1014   ON LEAVE OF fmin IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1015   DO:
     1016     assign fmin.
     1017     run check-time in this-procedure (input fmin:screen-value, input "min":U) no-error.
     1018     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
