     1023     run check-time in this-procedure (input fsec:screen-value, input "sec":U)  no-error.
     1024     if error-status:error then return no-apply.
     1025   END.
     1026   ON LEAVE OF thour IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1027   DO:
